  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Azerbaijan Delegation(2025 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Azerbaijan, the ICRC supports the families of missing persons and helps detainees held for conflict-related or security reasons, or who are otherwise vulnerable. We respond to such health issues as tuberculosis in prisons, and we monitor the situation of communities along the border with Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
